#: scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb784206ecbd8154dc72ee6228173039aed07c1e55125df3179f6a1090717201
#. default-sha256: 512589b2ad07d8919d55a887b1d0bb5efd149714894dbc3e372fcad80f58cbae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The next day, I awoke with a "
"terrible fever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Il giorno seguente mi svegliai con "
"una febbre terribile."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32f91c41153b2d2d52a2b9132e8baa32f9e72c5e2869f1d3b085a8707a6c9090
#. default-sha256: 662e1a5c6dc5f11f69f4fd5ea503b04fa9a2c1c9d830bf53709fdbdb165da46f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hovered in a sweltering wave of heat, unable to tell dream and reality apart, listening to "
"a seemingly endless stream of cracking noises."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero sommersa da una soffocante ondata di calore, incapace di distinguere sogno e realtà, "
"mentre ascoltavo una serie di scricchiolii apparentemente infinita."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d03f689e02c3d17d7b968712dc2acc2a1ca4f9a057c0a05eb62455546b3274a6
#. default-sha256: 156a521b3c8bde4fdf71ace68ceceab8d9d587e9d7ca316e00e74565f0c909d6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sounds were coming from inside my body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I thought I was falling apart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫I rumori provenivano dal mio corpo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pensavo che stessi per crollare a pezzi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11765afeb945326aa02813671774fccb8bd17c669f8d3e9d36b270ba2cd6cee5
#. default-sha256: 6e3d6f374aaed826b2492be2cdebcc0f26cf105a5a74484b92072ee518562c15
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was horribly worried."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mia Madre era terribilmente preoccupata."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84b6f709525dd475a8cb7ba4c3c36624e2764b8fa125279f78c463d91e3defaf
#. default-sha256: c292424274664037484237481133feef8b3a26d54edfe5766be3bc998d8e629b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never been the most healthy child, but I had never fallen this ill either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ero mai stata nelle migliori condizioni di salute, ma non mi ero mai nemmeno ammalata in "
"quel modo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3a779ec4fbf19fe430fa8c19d13136a46d3f62b91a5cddfecff29c0feaca834
#. default-sha256: c0b8b5fbd211980aec40d5058071e634e47da5908e17a3f9be5a59a067c8a27f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t get out of bed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My voice was raspy, like an old woman’s.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was "
"genuinely afraid I would wither away and die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non potevo uscire dal letto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La mia voce era rauca, come quella di una donna "
"anziana.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Avevo sinceramente paura di deperire fino a morire."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0842f879ddc5f5ba6b9e92c38659d269bdbb4b5690b6a32c9dc7fd23c17316cc
#. default-sha256: 729c1f931ad5341198a36cfb320aa0a7de8d3e5454e21fd0529bc0db329ca385
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother called in doctor after doctor to see me, but they all said it was the flu."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mia Madre fece venire un dottore dopo l’altro per vedermi,⟪k:1⟫ma dicevano tutti che era "
"l’influenza."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00279e902b91075359367983e284f7236eb9a8952e421f7ea8506aea285eea6c
#. default-sha256: b81d5f7d31258ce4f01a85206b2f6ec664bed067f320df48807f0e19fabcd8d1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That bodily pain was common with a fever."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era normale avere dolore con quella febbre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 291c45dd3b7ab745ab5a7a549adf170ef210b0ebaacf37c594e5f415b7d9c132
#. default-sha256: 0e9815d1500b0b6d588de71ac75d8be095636529577d8eb966d91d747a66bc5f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While there was a doctor in the house, Mother was able to remain relatively calm,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fintanto che c’era un dottore in casa, mia Madre era in grado di rimanere relativamente "
"calma,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c67856a76232839344feeb81e77eae2f21b3216693a57103736da62edbccbb73
#. default-sha256: ec3ed6b50ef2ae572431642dfe60990c4dc6644698f42edcd053bcb982af12e3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but once they were gone, the anxiety came back. ⟪k:1⟫She stayed with me, day and night, even "
"foregoing sleep."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma appena lui se ne andava, l’ansia tornava.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Restava con me, giorno e notte, "
"facendo persino a meno di dormire."

#: scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee910699f5e85ebeeb50f0b9bbd4a1f4aba532506458063f3e51be730f6e1195
#. default-sha256: 40ba17fda599452764907eab8bf82140762aece4df058cd7b2cf2446e87630c2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her hands gripped mine. They held me fast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le sue mani stringevano le mie con forza."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 077ca37229af5ddf14d5979a809e573f9981bceeba095cdf06b7f4dc17c3a9d2
#. default-sha256: 75e730c4dc722a4c1a00d784640a3fac5d97a17464bd234d10646f75445636e2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had her head bowed, as if in prayer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Teneva la testa china, come in preghiera."

#: scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14955fc9140fe3f103d7831ab2b86d5c2cc2c1ad2fb31d5654918879947794d0
#. default-sha256: 671d39fa696dc3316dd98e4e78448bf940634714dcecc4f82f357e422efda37f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Don’t worry... ⟪k:1⟫It’ll be all right, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫God is watching over you... ⟪k:4⟫"
"He will protect you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non preoccuparti... ⟪k:1⟫andrà tutto bene, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dio veglia su di te... ⟪k:4⟫ti "
"proteggerà..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9537089e80f1024c7705c292f08409b322532bf051c494f13e2f06a08bacdb01
#. default-sha256: 0ce759286fb68ecf69357ae94706df054d107efe429f2687c763a982e0728983
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are His child...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You are His angel sent to Earth..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tu sei la Sua bambina...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sei il Suo angelo mandato sulla Terra...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non ti "
"abbandonerà..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00a396440dc831f6404d4a4fb0ce4183762ad8b2ae61e28612b19f8a0ecb9a2a
#. default-sha256: 6d7c1ce53bbf75058e48facdde15e971cf7d600837ddad00925259692e36da3b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He will not forsake you...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The doctors say it’s just the flu..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫I dottori dicono che è soltanto l’influenza..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bd8029c043d6b165a15e12e66d927ed4a5793a6884fce46cf2d1b98df828d74
#. default-sha256: 31e76b6f6b3550b7c741666dc85fa31bee6801bfd48daa140dce461b6c193234
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though her words seemed to be directed at me, there was a vacantness in her voice, as if "
"they were really for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene le sue parole sembrassero dirette a me, c’era un certo sconforto nella sua voce, "
"come se fossero rivolte a se stessa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 300572fd678543cfd9c863d76cc3eb83ab80043d2deee89590195936ba9f166c
#. default-sha256: 9b4d5610c6216acf64834f7e563100edf80e0bef3099de3a97a944145e0d0673
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For so long, she had wanted a daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Aveva desiderato una figlia per tanto tempo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a954234f6bf1d303d4854dc19195e6b6471837657335b8c926e2579f62dc167f
#. default-sha256: 42954d5e42ef750f27029f9f27aa74ad1d503687a22dbc5896a619894f1b2710
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t understand her fixation,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non riuscivo a capire la sua fissazione,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5db9054737c05ff4afebeec9bafa54041a5260f508b7fc5902747c21a8cf4ee6
#. default-sha256: 364bb5def79d2c7b1a227c705ac2bce5cefbc59d3b66e6ade6730ccdadafa53b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but seeing her there through my cloudy eyes, I wanted to apologize for ever thinking "
"spending time with her was agonizing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma vedendola lì, attraverso i miei occhi annebbiati, volevo scusarmi per aver pensato che "
"trascorrere il tempo assieme a lei fosse un’agonia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49e9eeea96416e054ca1a54215ec187bcbedbf84b239d0a475ea02102167da90
#. default-sha256: 6b2099e57869da43732b40fc1e8d2bd1592cb8c870217c5b556bad8ab108b963
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How are you feeling?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Your mother’s here for you. Don’t worry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come ti senti?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non temere. Tua madre è qui per te."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0046f4b0d76d1f3b03b16dbfb4c9205efa5cd720d1be8afa0996dedf3a9f72f7
#. default-sha256: 386a06777b918d686f03b61b4544fa5fe7e43dd50bc55c85793bb4e72372e0fa
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the only sound that came from my mouth was a faint gasp."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma l’unico suono che uscì dalla mia bocca fu un debole rantolo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6894ca9cc87293dec7f174e7b75913b44cb3d3c29d192980a9cd0459174d95ce
#. default-sha256: 8cfe736f4afddfc05f877abb5646b8d4f38642837a64175ceb9722c17221eb8c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I drifted in and out of sleep, Mother’s hand wrapped around my own."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi addormentavo e mi risvegliavo di continuo, con mia Madre che continuava a stringermi le "
"mani."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98fccaae0a5b90162111a21641fb127bc61d7ea45a03ec697f239f3d1d9d19bb
#. default-sha256: 1eb247d1b129591f27a15c9865981851cfe650fd94cb0c6fdb5fa4bbd788018f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I had numerous dreams."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Feci diversi sogni."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ffffc274a69c91e99ea32f806cec48b51aa417e1b00b84e41abc2611047517b
#. default-sha256: bc022d6efeb84dd569dac66012efcb69e4ba3854521dcb9c5a9954de0df8b568
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was a man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nei miei sogni, ero un uomo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dd00673195c7b9776747e78f36f088411fe729b567bb8cb0310201c3ba9e81f
#. default-sha256: 959c0025fb8e3af4f6ffa43bf51972e9484495ab992c21fdbb3bf9edcebb2069
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was Didier and I was Georges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nei miei sogni, ero Didier, ed ero Georges."

#: scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd3391d14547573dc923734636d135eee368f47a815d7851d936ed407c6257c9
#. default-sha256: 215d148582e28f2564be7bd0b1046e0ed3f49cc0fdb4685e50ac1947c78f0715
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I fell in love with Aimee,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nei miei sogni, mi innamoravo di Aimee,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 232613ef93fcbee945898c0fd24c53204244d63c1d7daa0a7d50d3ea94cc79ce
#. default-sha256: d9aa2f698caf1a83eae023d033b1cf46c0c1fd8ddbb52a28224bad96c984a47b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and in my dreams, I loved her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e nei miei sogni, ci amavamo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A60B55F_1C1C_4AD1_8561_832959556D49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f270f22279e025ee563f7936731a04860235173fa0d26d22aae832f5ac503247
#. default-sha256: 8e9cfda4beb20fc3a20536a2c35301b180d72d3ddb493391d74b6d88c6cc59e7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A60B55F_1C1C_4AD1_8561_832959556D49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re disgusting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sei rivoltante."

